Deep Links
=======================================================
1. URL'S that open a specific screen inside your app.
=======================================================
=> Type os deep links
1. Basic Deep Link (Custom Scheme)
2. App Links (Android) / Universal Links (iOS)
=======================================================
=> Basic deep link flow
Case 1 : App Closed
- User clicks a link.
- OS launches the app
- Flutter receive's the initial link
- user navigates to the correct screen

Case 2 : App OPEN (background)
- User clicks the link
- App resumes
- Flutter receives stream event
- Navigate
=======================================================